                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "House Republicans just passed the largest cut to Medicaid in American history.\n\nThey are taking health care away from millions of Americans so they can cut taxes for their billionaire buddies.\n\nWhose side are they on? https://t.co/zvoc5TI1qA",
