                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\u201cWe have a sick care system \u2013 not a health care system.\u201d\n\n\u201cGovernment\u2019s job is to help people. It\u2019s not a business.\u201d\n\n\u201cPeople will give up on healthcare.\u201d\n\nThese are some of the important lessons learned at our roundtable on Medicaid and Medicare in our communities.\u00a0\n\nEveryone should understand that cutting service only shifts the burden and will actually increase costs for our neighbors.",
