                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "A woman\u2019s right to make her own healthcare decisions was ripped away and placed in the hands of Republican politicians with the Dobbs decision.\n\nI will never ease up on the fight for the majority of Americans who believe individuals \u2013 not politicians \u2013 should have freedom over their own bodies.\n\nThis week, I\u2019m proud to reintroduce the Women\u2019s Health Protection Act that would enshrine a woman\u2019s right to choose.",
