                "quoted_status_profile_username": "Gruen75",
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thank you for your work, AARP Illinois!\n\nTogether, we will protect Medicare and fight to lower the cost of prescriptions.\n\nStripping seniors from their safety net while giving billionaires a hand out is wrong and I will fight every day to protect my neighbors.",
