                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The president\u2019s bill is ugly, horrific, and un-American!\n\nI won\u2019t stand by while Washington plays politics with food and healthcare for Illinois families. https://t.co/D5R1JsZeaP",
