                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Touring Project NOW\u2019s Head Start, I saw what\u2019s really at stake.\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f 90% of these kids need Medicaid\n\u27a1\ufe0f 61% need SNAP\n\nWhen funding for programs gets cut, it\u2019s not just numbers on a page \u2014 it\u2019s families going without the care and meals. \n\nOur children deserve better. No matter what happens in Washington, I\u2019ll keep fighting to put children and families first.",
