                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Did you know Illinois leads the nation in soybeans?\n\nMembers of Illinois Soy were on hand to deliver updates on member needs and we talked about crop insurance, trade, and the 40A blender\u2019s tax credit \u2013 which I proudly support.\n\nIllinois grows soy better than anybody, which is why I am all-in on the work to support farmers.",
