                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "60 years ago today, leaders from both parties came together to pass Medicare and Medicaid \u2013 that changed American lives for the better.\n\nUnfortunately, only Democrats are keeping the promise today.\n\u2192 Protecting Medicare.\n\u2192 Defending Medicaid.\n\u2192 Fighting against cuts.\n\nThese programs are lifelines for families in IL-17, and they\u2019re worth fighting for.",
