                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Celebrated 60 years of Medicare and Medicaid with local union members, retirees, and advocates at IBEW Local 34.\n\nThese programs have helped generations of people get the care they need and deserve! I\u2019m proud to keep fighting to protect them. https://t.co/ki0E7mTV5s",
