                "text": "60% of children in the OSF Children\u2019s Hospital rely on Medicaid\u2014and their care is under threat. Grateful for the chance to visit the staff and especially meet 12 year old Jordy. He inspired me more than anyone will know.\n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting in Congress to protect the health of every child and every family in IL-17.",
